# Job Finder Feature

Standalone feature (not LangGraph). Users confirm filters, search one company
at a time, pick roles from careers/ATS boards, then start the normal workflow.

## Product

- Route: `/dashboard/find-jobs` (Applications remains home)
- API: `/api/v1/job-finder`
- Discover + analyze only — never auto-apply
- CTA copy: **Add to applications** / **Analyze** — never “Apply”
- No job-board aggregators (blocklist in `utils/job_finder/blocklists.py`)
- Never name specific job-board brands in user-facing copy

## Architecture

- Providers: `utils/job_finder/providers/*` + `registry.py`
- SSRF HTTP: `utils/job_finder/http.py` — HTTPS only, allow/block lists, async DNS, **IP-pinned TLS** (SNI/`Host`), no redirects, size cap
- Orchestrator: `utils/job_finder/orchestrator.py`
- Resolver agent: `agents/job_finder_resolver.py` (grounded search; LLM must not invent job lists)
- Persistence: `job_finder_sessions` table (migration `20260720_028`)
- Select → `start_workflow_from_job_finder()` in `api/workflow.py` (**sequential** starts; `InputMethod.JOB_FINDER`)

## Rate limits

- Chat turns: 30/hour (`{user_id}:job_finder_chat:30ph`)
- Workflow starts: existing 30/hour

## Settings

- `JOB_FINDER_ENABLED` (default true)
- `JOB_FINDER_GROUNDING_ENABLED` (default true; off for Ollama)

## WebSocket (on `/ws/user`)

- `job_finder_status`
- `job_finder_message`
- `job_finder_error`

## Cache keys

- `v1:job_finder_board:{provider}:{slug}` — 20 min
- `v1:job_finder_company:{hash}` — 24 h
- `v1:job_finder_turn:{user_id}:{session_id}` — NX lock 2 min

